  pm-x705zo,implements,"2026-08-25T05:08:17.895Z","harness:codex","cli:create:dep",detected
comments[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-25T05:08:17.895Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check evidence: searched all statuses for stateless MCP server/discover request metadata protocolVersion clientCapabilities serverInfo resultType initialize removal and unsupported version handling. Existing handshake work is terminal and targets 2025-06-18."
body: "## Contract\n\n- Implement server/discover with supported versions, capabilities, extensions, and server identity.\n- Require and validate io.modelcontextprotocol/protocolVersion and clientCapabilities in request _meta.\n- Accept request-local clientInfo and return serverInfo in result _meta.\n- Return UnsupportedProtocolVersionError and MissingRequiredClientCapability with current allocated codes.\n- Add required resultType complete and input_required handling while treating older omitted resultType as complete only inside the compatibility adapter.\n- Remove runtime dependence on initialize and notifications/initialized.\n- Keep deterministic capability ordering and one SDK-owned schema for CLI, MCP, tests, contracts, and docs."
